# v18 Design System — Admin CMS only

> **Scope changed.** This system applies to `/admin` routes only. It must never
> be applied to the public storefront. For storefront work, follow
> `storefront-design-system.mdc` instead.

## Mental model

**Blue chrome, white content.** The shell (sidebar, gradient background, page
headers) is blue with white text. All readable/interactive content sits on
white cards with dark text.

## Color tokens (globals.css @theme)

| Role | Token |
|------|-------|
| Primary blue | `--color-v18-primary` / `--color-v18-primary-mid` |
| Sidebar | `--color-v18-sidebar-from` → `--color-v18-sidebar-to` |
| Body gradient | `--color-v18-bg-from` → `--color-v18-bg-mid` → `--color-v18-bg-to` |
| Headings on white | `--color-v18-heading` (#1e293b) |
| Muted text | `--color-v18-muted` (#64748b) |
| Borders | `--color-v18-border` |
| Avatar accent | `--color-v18-avatar-from` / `--color-v18-avatar-to` |

## Utility classes

- `.v18-body-gradient` — main area background
- `.v18-sidebar` — left nav chrome
- `.v18-card` — white content surface (20px radius)
- `.v18-stat-card` — KPI tiles (16px radius)
- `.v18-btn-primary` — blue gradient button (44px min height)
- `.v18-text-on-gradient` / `.v18-text-muted-on-gradient` — titles on blue bg

## Layout shell

Use `V18Shell` + `V18Sidebar` + `V18TopNav` from `components/shared/` for
**admin CMS routes only** (`app/admin/(cms)/**`).

## Do

- Use `PageHeader` with `variant="onGradient"` for page titles on the gradient
- Put forms, tables, and data grids inside `.v18-card`
- Use shadcn `Button` default variant (maps to v18 primary gradient)
- Keep auth pages (`/admin/login`) on separate styling
- Make the sidebar a drawer below `lg` — it must not offset content on mobile

## Don't

- **Never** use `V18Shell` or any `v18-*` token/class on storefront routes
- Put dark headings directly on the gradient (except `PageHeader`)
- Use storefront gold/off-white (`store-*`) tokens on admin pages
- Mix admin-only naming (`admin-*`) — use `v18-*` tokens/classes
